  "description": "Mejorada con el simulador del coach desde \u0022WesternAOE Rush Updated\u0022, con la misma estrategia: Antes de \u0022Construir 1 molino \u2192 bayas\u0022: \u002B1 en madera, -1 en ovejas; \u0022Mover 5 de ovejas a madera\u0022 antes que \u0022Construir 1 casa \u2192 madera\u0022; \u0022Construir 3 casas \u2192 madera\u0022 antes que \u0022Construir 1 establo \u2192 madera\u0022; \u0022Mover 3 de bayas a oro\u0022 antes que \u0022Construir 1 campamento minero \u2192 oro\u0022. Simulada antes: Edad Feudal 7:30, Edad de los Castillos 19:27, fin 24:37, centro urbano parado 0 s. Despu\u00E9s: Edad Feudal 7:30, Edad de los Castillos 18:13, fin 23:23, centro urbano parado 0 s. WesternAOE build order for the Franks.   This build order is designed to maximize damage and disrupt your opponent\u0027s economy by utilizing the Franks\u0027 strengths. While there is a small element of micro involved, the primary objective of this build is to disrupt the enemy economy count during the Feudal Age with the scouts. By doing so, you\u0027ll have ample time to build up a formidable force of knights once you\u0027re in Castle Age. Fuente: https://www.buildorderguide.com/builds/JMmYa7X0rqYSJ4t3uJaa.",
